sequenceDiagram
  participant WA as WhatsApp Provider
  participant API as Nexso Backend
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant VN as Vendor

  WA->>API: POST /webhook/whatsapp (raw payload)
  API->>API: Verify signature (stub)
  API->>DB: Insert raw payload (idempotent)
  API->>DB: Lookup sender by whatsapp_number
  API->>API: Detect intent (keyword/menu)
  alt intent = CREATE_TICKET
    API->>DB: Dedup check (user+category+time window)
    API->>DB: Insert ticket (status OPEN)
    API->>DB: Find vendors by society+category
    API->>DB: Assign vendor + set status ASSIGNED
    API->>VN: Send WhatsApp notification (stub)
    API->>DB: Log notification activity
  else intent = UPDATE_TICKET
    API->>DB: Fetch ticket by ticket_id
    API->>API: Validate role-based transition
    API->>DB: Update status
    API->>DB: Insert activity log
  else OTHER
    API->>DB: Store message attached to conversation (future)
  end
  API-->>WA: 200 OK (ack)
